  "body": "We currently have QR code cross-signing. You will typically perform the cross-signing immediately after you login on a new device.\r\n\r\nDiscord currently allows users to login with QR codes if they are already logged in on another device.\r\n\r\nIt seems like the obvious next step in terms of better UX is to kill two birds with one stone. I suggest that there be an option to login and cross-sign a new device simultaneously with one QR code.\r\n\r\nIn 99% of cases wherein you are verifying a new device, you will have just recently logged in anyway, so why not make it simpler & quicker?",
